      <p>{"The incomplete October 16 series on the two-CPU host is kept outside these medians. Its first Tool Kumar 100 KB minified run had a 688.3 ms rAF median and 1,253.1 ms p95, beside JSON Formatter Online at 51.4 ms and 83.7 ms. Tool Kumar's prettified partner was 24.4 ms and 32.2 ms, beside 10.8 ms and 18.1 ms. These are single-run observations, not historical three-run cells. Their raw references remain in the study."}</p>
